## Or-patterns

```catala
declaration enumeration E:
  -- A content integer
  -- B content integer
  -- C content (integer, money)
  -- D content (money, integer)
  -- F

declaration scope S:
  input v content E
  output o content integer
  output b content boolean

scope S:
  definition o equals
    match v with pattern
    -- A content x or B content x : x
    -- FirstLongConstructorName content (a, b)
    or SecondLongConstructorName content (b, a) :
      a
    -- C content (x, y) or D content (y, x) : x
    -- anything : 0

  definition b equals
    match v with pattern
    -- A or B : true or false
    -- C
    or D
    or F : false
```
